@startuml
title POST /api/posts/{postId}/comments - Create Comment

actor Client
participant AuthFilter
participant CommentController
participant CreateCommentService
participant PostRepository
participant UserRepository
participant CommentRepository
database Database

Client -> AuthFilter: POST /api/posts/{postId}/comments(CreateCommentRequest)
AuthFilter -> AuthFilter: validate JWT
AuthFilter -> CommentController: forward request with currentUserId
activate CommentController

CommentController -> CreateCommentService: createComment(postId, currentUserId, request)
activate CreateCommentService

CreateCommentService -> CreateCommentService: validate request\n(content not empty)

CreateCommentService -> PostRepository: findById(postId)
PostRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM posts WHERE id = ?
Database --> PostRepository: post row
PostRepository --> CreateCommentService: Optional<Post>

alt Post not found
    CreateCommentService --> CommentController: PostNotFoundException
    CommentController --> Client: 404 Not Found
else Post found
    CreateCommentService -> CreateCommentService: check post visibility\nand access permission

    alt No access to post
        CreateCommentService --> CommentController: ForbiddenException
        CommentController --> Client: 403 Forbidden
    else Has access
        CreateCommentService -> UserRepository: findById(currentUserId)
        UserRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?
        Database --> UserRepository: user row
        UserRepository --> CreateCommentService: Optional<User>

        opt parentCommentId provided
            CreateCommentService -> CommentRepository: findById(parentCommentId)
            CommentRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM comments WHERE id = ?
            Database --> CommentRepository: comment row
            CommentRepository --> CreateCommentService: Optional<Comment>

            alt Parent comment not found
                CreateCommentService --> CommentController: CommentNotFoundException
                CommentController --> Client: 404 Not Found
            else Parent comment found
                CreateCommentService -> CreateCommentService: verify parent belongs to same post
            end
        end

        CreateCommentService -> CreateCommentService: create Comment entity

        CreateCommentService -> CommentRepository: save(comment)
        CommentRepository -> Database: INSERT INTO comments
        Database --> CommentRepository: saved comment
        CommentRepository --> CreateCommentService: Comment

        CreateCommentService -> PostRepository: incrementCommentCount(postId)
        PostRepository -> Database: UPDATE posts SET comment_count = comment_count + 1\nWHERE id = ?
        Database --> PostRepository: void

        CreateCommentService --> CommentController: CreateCommentResponse
        deactivate CreateCommentService

        CommentController --> Client: 201 Created(response)
        deactivate CommentController
    end
end

alt Unauthorized
    AuthFilter --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
end

@enduml

@startuml
title GET /api/posts/{postId}/comments - Get Post Comments

actor Client
participant AuthFilter
participant CommentController
participant GetCommentsService
participant PostRepository
participant CommentRepository
participant UserRepository
participant CommentMapper
database Database

Client -> AuthFilter: GET /api/posts/{postId}/comments?page={page}&size={size}
AuthFilter -> AuthFilter: validate JWT (optional)
AuthFilter -> CommentController: forward request with currentUserId (if authenticated)
activate CommentController

CommentController -> GetCommentsService: getComments(postId, pageable, currentUserId)
activate GetCommentsService

GetCommentsService -> PostRepository: findById(postId)
PostRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM posts WHERE id = ?
Database --> PostRepository: post row
PostRepository --> GetCommentsService: Optional<Post>

alt Post not found
    GetCommentsService --> CommentController: PostNotFoundException
    CommentController --> Client: 404 Not Found
else Post found
    GetCommentsService -> GetCommentsService: check post visibility\nand access permission

    alt No access to post
        GetCommentsService --> CommentController: ForbiddenException
        CommentController --> Client: 403 Forbidden
    else Has access
        GetCommentsService -> CommentRepository: findByPostId(postId, pageable)
        CommentRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM comments\nWHERE post_id = ? AND parent_id IS NULL\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT ? OFFSET ?
        Database --> CommentRepository: comment rows
        CommentRepository --> GetCommentsService: Page<Comment>

        loop for each comment
            GetCommentsService -> UserRepository: findById(comment.authorId)
            UserRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?
            Database --> UserRepository: user row
            UserRepository --> GetCommentsService: Optional<User>

            GetCommentsService -> CommentRepository: countReplies(commentId)
            CommentRepository -> Database: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM comments\nWHERE parent_id = ?
            Database --> CommentRepository: count
            CommentRepository --> GetCommentsService: replyCount

            opt currentUserId provided
                GetCommentsService -> GetCommentsService: check if liked by current user
            end

            GetCommentsService -> CommentMapper: toCommentResponse(comment, author, replyCount, isLiked)
            CommentMapper --> GetCommentsService: CommentResponse
        end

        GetCommentsService --> CommentController: Page<CommentResponse>
        deactivate GetCommentsService

        CommentController --> Client: 200 OK(response)
        deactivate CommentController
    end
end

@enduml

@startuml
title GET /api/comments/{commentId}/replies - Get Comment Replies

actor Client
participant AuthFilter
participant CommentController
participant GetCommentRepliesService
participant CommentRepository
participant UserRepository
participant CommentMapper
database Database

Client -> AuthFilter: GET /api/comments/{commentId}/replies?page={page}&size={size}
AuthFilter -> AuthFilter: validate JWT (optional)
AuthFilter -> CommentController: forward request with currentUserId (if authenticated)
activate CommentController

CommentController -> GetCommentRepliesService: getReplies(commentId, pageable, currentUserId)
activate GetCommentRepliesService

GetCommentRepliesService -> CommentRepository: findById(commentId)
CommentRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM comments WHERE id = ?
Database --> CommentRepository: comment row
CommentRepository --> GetCommentRepliesService: Optional<Comment>

alt Comment not found
    GetCommentRepliesService --> CommentController: CommentNotFoundException
    CommentController --> Client: 404 Not Found
else Comment found
    GetCommentRepliesService -> CommentRepository: findReplies(commentId, pageable)
    CommentRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM comments\nWHERE parent_id = ?\nORDER BY created_at ASC\nLIMIT ? OFFSET ?
    Database --> CommentRepository: reply rows
    CommentRepository --> GetCommentRepliesService: Page<Comment>

    loop for each reply
        GetCommentRepliesService -> UserRepository: findById(reply.authorId)
        UserRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?
        Database --> UserRepository: user row
        UserRepository --> GetCommentRepliesService: Optional<User>

        opt currentUserId provided
            GetCommentRepliesService -> GetCommentRepliesService: check if liked by current user
        end

        GetCommentRepliesService -> CommentMapper: toCommentResponse(reply, author, 0, isLiked)
        CommentMapper --> GetCommentRepliesService: CommentResponse
    end

    GetCommentRepliesService --> CommentController: Page<CommentResponse>
    deactivate GetCommentRepliesService

    CommentController --> Client: 200 OK(response)
    deactivate CommentController
end

@enduml

@startuml
title PUT /api/comments/{commentId} - Update Comment

actor Client
participant AuthFilter
participant CommentController
participant UpdateCommentService
participant CommentRepository
database Database

Client -> AuthFilter: PUT /api/comments/{commentId}(UpdateCommentRequest)
AuthFilter -> AuthFilter: validate JWT
AuthFilter -> CommentController: forward request with currentUserId
activate CommentController

CommentController -> UpdateCommentService: updateComment(commentId, currentUserId, request)
activate UpdateCommentService

UpdateCommentService -> CommentRepository: findById(commentId)
CommentRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM comments WHERE id = ?
Database --> CommentRepository: comment row
CommentRepository --> UpdateCommentService: Optional<Comment>

alt Comment not found
    UpdateCommentService --> CommentController: CommentNotFoundException
    CommentController --> Client: 404 Not Found
else Comment found
    UpdateCommentService -> UpdateCommentService: check ownership\n(comment.authorId == currentUserId)

    alt Not owner
        UpdateCommentService --> CommentController: ForbiddenException
        CommentController --> Client: 403 Forbidden
    else Owner
        UpdateCommentService -> UpdateCommentService: validate request\n(content not empty)

        UpdateCommentService -> UpdateCommentService: update Comment entity
        UpdateCommentService -> CommentRepository: save(comment)
        CommentRepository -> Database: UPDATE comments SET content = ?, updated_at = ?\nWHERE id = ?
        Database --> CommentRepository: updated comment
        CommentRepository --> UpdateCommentService: Comment

        UpdateCommentService --> CommentController: UpdateCommentResponse
        deactivate UpdateCommentService

        CommentController --> Client: 200 OK(response)
        deactivate CommentController
    end
end

alt Unauthorized
    AuthFilter --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
end

@enduml

@startuml
title DELETE /api/comments/{commentId} - Delete Comment

actor Client
participant AuthFilter
participant CommentController
participant DeleteCommentService
participant CommentRepository
participant PostRepository
database Database

Client -> AuthFilter: DELETE /api/comments/{commentId}
AuthFilter -> AuthFilter: validate JWT
AuthFilter -> CommentController: forward request with currentUserId
activate CommentController

CommentController -> DeleteCommentService: deleteComment(commentId, currentUserId)
activate DeleteCommentService

DeleteCommentService -> CommentRepository: findById(commentId)
CommentRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM comments WHERE id = ?
Database --> CommentRepository: comment row
CommentRepository --> DeleteCommentService: Optional<Comment>

alt Comment not found
    DeleteCommentService --> CommentController: CommentNotFoundException
    CommentController --> Client: 404 Not Found
else Comment found
    DeleteCommentService -> DeleteCommentService: check ownership\n(comment.authorId == currentUserId)

    alt Not owner
        DeleteCommentService --> CommentController: ForbiddenException
        CommentController --> Client: 403 Forbidden
    else Owner
        DeleteCommentService -> DeleteCommentService: begin transaction

        DeleteCommentService -> CommentRepository: countReplies(commentId)
        CommentRepository -> Database: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM comments\nWHERE parent_id = ?
        Database --> CommentRepository: count
        CommentRepository --> DeleteCommentService: replyCount

        DeleteCommentService -> CommentRepository: deleteReplies(commentId)
        CommentRepository -> Database: DELETE FROM comments WHERE parent_id = ?
        Database --> CommentRepository: deleted count

        DeleteCommentService -> CommentRepository: delete(comment)
        CommentRepository -> Database: DELETE FROM comments WHERE id = ?
        Database --> CommentRepository: void

        DeleteCommentService -> PostRepository: decrementCommentCount(postId, totalDeleted)
        PostRepository -> Database: UPDATE posts SET comment_count = comment_count - ?\nWHERE id = ?
        Database --> PostRepository: void

        DeleteCommentService -> DeleteCommentService: commit transaction

        DeleteCommentService --> CommentController: void
        deactivate DeleteCommentService

        CommentController --> Client: 204 No Content
        deactivate CommentController
    end
end

alt Unauthorized
    AuthFilter --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
end

@enduml
